# Cargo.lock IS committed. The primary deps are already rev-pinned in Cargo.toml,
# but tracking the lock also freezes the crates.io deps (postcard / rand / serde /
# rayon / tracing …) so a fresh clone builds against the exact validated versions.
# (plonky2/Cargo.lock is likewise tracked.)

/paper
